[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Stop Thief!]
[00:01.60]How did Roy stop the thieves? | 罗伊是怎样制止小偷的？
[00:15.46]Roy Trenton used to drive a taxi. | 罗伊·特伦顿以前是开出租车的。
[00:20.18]A short while ago, however, | 然而，不久前，
[00:23.40]he became a bus driver | 他当上了一名公共汽车司机，
[00:25.78]and he has not regretted it. | 他一点也不后悔。
[00:28.68]He is finding his new work far more exciting. | 他觉得自己的新工作更加激动人心。
[00:33.87]When he was driving | 最近，当他开着车
[00:35.89]along Catford Street recently, | 沿卡特福德大街行驶时，
[00:38.68]he saw two thieves rush out of a shop | 他看见两个小偷从一家商店里冲出来，
[00:42.82]and run towards a waiting car. | 朝一辆等在那里的汽车跑去。
[00:45.88]One of them was carrying a bag full of money. | 其中一个提着一满袋钱。
[00:50.80]Roy acted quickly and drove the bus | 罗伊迅速行动，
[00:54.55]straight at the thieves. | 把公共汽车径直朝小偷开去。
[00:56.76]The one with the money got such a fright | 拿钱的那个小偷吓了一大跳，
[01:00.52]that he dropped the bag. | 把袋子都弄掉了。
[01:02.74]As the thieves were trying to get away in their car, | 当小偷们试图乘车逃跑时，
[01:07.30]Roy drove his bus into the back of it. | 罗伊开着公共汽车撞在小偷汽车的尾部。
[01:11.34]While the battered car was moving away, | 就在那辆被撞坏的汽车开走的时候，
[01:15.16]Roy stopped his bus and telephoned the police. | 罗伊停下公共汽车给警察打了电话。
[01:19.10]The thieves' car was badly damaged and easy to recognize. | 小偷的汽车已严重受损，很容易辨认。
[01:24.68]Shortly afterwards, | 不久，
[01:27.00]the police stopped the car and both men were arrested. | 警察截住了那辆汽车，两名男子都被捕了。